29tv|n|Something that has short turns or angles. ; A molding running in a zigzag line; a chevron, or series of chevrons. See Illust. of Chevron, 3. ; See Boyau.	N:rr4,82,1~rr4,82,1
29v6|n|A rare element of the carbon-silicon group, intermediate between the metals and nonmetals, obtained from the mineral zircon as a dark sooty powder, or as a gray metallic crystalline substance. Symbol Zr. Atomic weight, 90.4.	N:1flf,153,3~1flf,153,3
